  "description": "The Word document model and editing API for DocWright: create, read and change sections, paragraphs, tables, styles, lists, pictures, shapes, charts, fields, tracked changes, content controls and form fields, with find/replace, {{placeholder}} filling, undoable edits, tables of contents and field updates. Markup the model does not represent is preserved and wins on save, so a load-and-save round trip is lossless. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
